textfont=museo_sans_11pt_regular
fontmono=no
text=Welcome to the Power to the Players polls!<br><br>These polls ask you to vote for your favourite updates.<br>The winning options then get put into the game!<br>You must be a member to vote in the majority of these polls.<br><br>Subscribe now and change the future of RuneScape. 
